{"4674370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Starving Shadows", "steam_appid": 4674370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4839980], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is Starving Shadows?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game where you can eat any enemy (and friend too). What you eat affects your stats and character progression. You can also have companions, and they might not like what you're eating — and that will have consequences too. This is a game about choices that shape who you become. Try to escape this starving dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is a vast dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are one of its countless inhabitants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One thing is clear: to live, you must eat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Devour — or be devoured.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legends say there is a way to the surface. That the sun is not a myth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You decided to fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well then, fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the right to see its rays in this grim point-and-click RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4674370/extras/8bcc1dadb0fc1cb137f342cece178376.poster.avif?t=1785918933\" width=624 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4674370/extras/8bcc1dadb0fc1cb137f342cece178376.webm?t=1785918933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4674370/extras/8bcc1dadb0fc1cb137f342cece178376.mp4?t=1785918933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique style made entirely from photographs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunger mechanic — eat your enemies!</p><p class=\